msgstr "เขียนรีวิว"

#: includes/class-segurium-review-prompt.php:461
#: includes/class-segurium.php:1215
msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "ไว้ทีหลัง"

#: includes/class-segurium-review-prompt.php:463
